{"s":61,"v":[{"t":"Whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth exalts Allāh, and He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise.","w":[["سَبَّحَ","Glorifies","sabbaḥa",""],["لِلَّهِ","Allah","lillahi","",[["لِ",8],["لَّهِ",9]]],["مَا","whatever","mā",""],["فِى","(is) in","fī",""],["ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","the heavens","l-samāwāti","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَـٰوَٰتِ",49]]],["وَمَا","and whatever","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["فِى","(is) in","fī",""],["ٱلْأَرْضِ","the earth","l-arḍi","ۖ",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضِ",35]]],["وَهُوَ","And He","wahuwa","",[["وَ",1],["هُوَ",5]]],["ٱلْعَزِيزُ","(is) the All-Mighty","l-ʿazīzu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عَزِيزُ",130]]],["ٱلْحَكِيمُ","the All-Wise","l-ḥakīmu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَكِيمُ",133]]]]},{"t":"O you who have believed, why do you say what you do not do?","w":[["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","O","yāayyuhā","",[["يَ",42],["ـٰٓأَيُّ",71],["هَا",0]]],["ٱلَّذِينَ","(you) who","alladhīna",""],["ءَامَنُوا۟","believe","āmanū","",[["ءَامَنُ",30],["وا۟",3]]],["لِمَ","Why","lima","",[["لِ",8],["مَ",12]]],["تَقُولُونَ","(do) you say","taqūlūna","",[["تَقُولُ",16],["ونَ",4]]],["مَا","what","mā",""],["لَا","not","lā",""],["تَفْعَلُونَ","you do","tafʿalūna","",[["تَفْعَلُ",141],["ونَ",4]]]]},{"t":"Greatly hateful in the sight of Allāh is that you say what you do not do.","w":[["كَبُرَ","Great is","kabura",""],["مَقْتًا","hatred","maqtan",""],["عِندَ","with","ʿinda",""],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["أَن","that","an",""],["تَقُولُوا۟","you say","taqūlū","",[["تَقُولُ",16],["وا۟",4]]],["مَا","what","mā",""],["لَا","not","lā",""],["تَفْعَلُونَ","you do","tafʿalūna","",[["تَفْعَلُ",141],["ونَ",4]]]]},{"t":"Indeed, Allāh loves those who fight in His cause in a row as though they are a [single] structure joined firmly.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["يُحِبُّ","loves","yuḥibbu",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["يُقَـٰتِلُونَ","fight","yuqātilūna","",[["يُقَـٰتِلُ",229],["ونَ",3]]],["فِى","in","fī",""],["سَبِيلِهِۦ","His Way","sabī